A props object containing a "key" prop is being spread into JSX:
  let props = %s;
  <%s {...props} />
React keys must be passed directly to JSX without using spread:
  let props = %s;
  <%s key={someKey} {...props} /> {key: someKey, disabled: ..., showLabel: ..., dropZoneOptions: ..., placeholderText: ..., placeholderDropText: ..., placeholderTextClass: ..., dropContainerClass: ...} Memo {disabled: ..., showLabel: ..., dropZoneOptions: ..., placeholderText: ..., placeholderDropText: ..., placeholderTextClass: ..., dropContainerClass: ...} Memo
